 "phase": "W3f: the page prefetches while the program starts",
 "change": "wasi-worker.js: the worker only probes the cache (one file fetched, then read synchronously; its timing entry must show no transfer) and, once the module is instantiated, hands the page the list (the startup package first, then listing order); the program starts at once. read() raises a shared fetch gate while a synchronous read is in flight. run.html: fetchAll runs 4 lanes; until the first frame no lane starts a file while the gate is up (the program's reads first), afterwards two lanes go on regardless; failures counted (prefetchFailed), back-off, 4xx not retried; lanes stop when the game ends; progress on the loading notice, then in a corner. web_app.py docstring. No game, Core or Swift change.",
